1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,167
<i> Joey visited me?</i>

2
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:02,700
<i> I saw her downstairs, leaving.</i>

3
00:00:02,833 --> 00:00:05,600
<i>- Zoey, was Joey here earlier?
- Yes.</i>

4
00:00:05,733 --> 00:00:06,533
<i>And you barred her
from going in?</i>

5
00:00:06,667 --> 00:00:08,400
<i>I am just protecting you
from her.</i>

6
00:00:08,533 --> 00:00:10,400
<i>Leave. I don't want
to hurt you anymore.</i>

7
00:00:10,533 --> 00:00:12,600
<i>Why don't we explore
private care for her?</i>

8
00:00:12,733 --> 00:00:14,067
<i> Will mommy be away from us?</i>

9
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:15,200
<i> I want to go.</i>

10
00:00:15,333 --> 00:00:17,567
<i>Jin Ho, we need your help.
Can we meet again?</i>

11
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:18,767
<i> Where are you going?</i>

12
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:21,000
<i>My friends rescheduled.
I'm just meeting them now.</i>

13
00:00:21,133 --> 00:00:22,033
<i> We'll follow someone.</i>

14
00:00:22,167 --> 00:00:23,233
<i> Joey, stop this.</i>

15
00:00:23,367 --> 00:00:25,000
<i>What if they do something worse
to you?</i>

16
00:00:25,133 --> 00:00:26,400
<i>Andrew, I don't want
that to happen</i>

17
00:00:26,533 --> 00:00:27,900
<i> because I love you.</i>

18
00:00:47,633 --> 00:00:49,533
I love you, Andrew.

19
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,867
Joey...

20
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,967
[SENTIMENTAL MUSIC PLAYING]

21
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:59,200
[SOBBING]

22
00:00:59,333 --> 00:01:04,867
You know, a lot of people have
asked me how I feel for you.

23
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,967
But I didn't answer them

24
00:01:08,133 --> 00:01:12,533
because I should admit it
to you first, right?

25
00:01:12,667 --> 00:01:14,633
You should be the first to know.

26
00:01:16,133 --> 00:01:18,900
Because this is the first time
I've ever felt this way.

27
00:01:20,233 --> 00:01:21,500
I was even one
of your bashers, remember?

28
00:01:21,633 --> 00:01:23,133
I didn't even like you.

29
00:01:23,267 --> 00:01:26,667
But as we spent time together,

30
00:01:28,267 --> 00:01:30,533
I became impressed with you.

31
00:01:30,667 --> 00:01:33,433
You're amazing in everything
you do.

32
00:01:33,567 --> 00:01:35,367
Your conviction is strong,

33
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:38,667
and you always help me,
you help my family.

34
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:44,067
I tried to stop myself
from liking you, but...

35
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:46,767
[STAMMERS]
I don't know.

36
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:48,867
Joey...

37
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,100
I don't know.

38
00:01:50,233 --> 00:01:53,533
When I saw you hurt...

39
00:01:54,633 --> 00:01:58,567
That's when I realized
you're so important to me.

40
00:01:59,900 --> 00:02:02,767
- That I love you, Andrew.
- Joey, Joey...

41
00:02:04,100 --> 00:02:06,167
I love you, Andrew.

42
00:02:08,067 --> 00:02:10,367
I love you, Andrew.

43
00:02:13,133 --> 00:02:14,967
<i> Joey, this is wrong.</i>

44
00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:18,567
You're still young.

45
00:02:19,900 --> 00:02:22,367
Joey, you don't know
what you're saying.

46
00:02:24,067 --> 00:02:27,767
Age has nothing to do with it.
I know what I feel.

47
00:02:27,900 --> 00:02:32,033
Joey, you only think that
because we're always together.

48
00:02:32,167 --> 00:02:33,767
But those feelings...

49
00:02:34,867 --> 00:02:37,233
Joey, they will change.

50
00:02:37,367 --> 00:02:38,533
You're still young.

51
00:02:40,267 --> 00:02:41,533
[EMOTIONAL MUSIC PLAYING]

52
00:02:41,667 --> 00:02:44,467
You know,
I'd rather you reject me.

53
00:02:47,100 --> 00:02:50,133
But to invalidate what I feel...

54
00:02:52,267 --> 00:02:55,300
It makes me feel so small,
Andrew.

55
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,500
But it's okay.

56
00:03:00,633 --> 00:03:03,367
At least now I know
how you feel.

57
00:03:05,100 --> 00:03:09,233
If I ever did something,
showing you false hope,

58
00:03:09,367 --> 00:03:10,400
I'm sorry.

59
00:03:11,533 --> 00:03:12,867
I was careless.

60
00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:17,933
If I made you expect.
I'm sorry, Joey.

61
00:03:18,067 --> 00:03:20,567
If you're angry with me,
I'll accept it.

62
00:03:23,100 --> 00:03:25,333
But please, Joey, listen to me.

63
00:03:27,833 --> 00:03:32,533
Stop going after Jin Ho, please.

64
00:03:34,500 --> 00:03:37,367
[TENSE PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

65
00:03:37,500 --> 00:03:38,867
You're crazy!

66
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,033
Peter!

67
00:03:41,067 --> 00:03:41,833
Peter!

68
00:03:41,967 --> 00:03:43,567
I'm a man, Andrew!

69
00:03:43,700 --> 00:03:45,733
I saw everything you did
to Joey!

70
00:03:45,867 --> 00:03:46,733
And what?

71
00:03:46,867 --> 00:03:48,500
I know it's not just
because you're kind!

72
00:03:48,633 --> 00:03:51,100
You made her hope!
You made her believe!

73
00:03:51,233 --> 00:03:53,533
Then you say sorry
that you were careless?

74
00:03:53,700 --> 00:03:54,667
Peter!

75
00:03:55,700 --> 00:03:56,567
Peter!

76
00:03:56,700 --> 00:03:57,800
Joey!

77
00:03:59,333 --> 00:04:00,900
What's happening?

78
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:05,733
Joey...

79
00:04:05,867 --> 00:04:07,533
Why are you crying?
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]

80
00:04:08,900 --> 00:04:10,433
I'm sorry, Joey.

81
00:04:12,033 --> 00:04:14,000
Maybe it's better...

82
00:04:14,133 --> 00:04:15,833
if I stay away from you.

83
00:04:15,967 --> 00:04:17,700
Yes, you should leave!

84
00:04:17,833 --> 00:04:27,800
[DRAMATIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

85
00:04:30,667 --> 00:04:32,433
[ENGINE STARTS]

86
00:04:33,667 --> 00:04:43,000
[DRAMATIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

87
00:04:43,133 --> 00:04:45,067
Let's go inside.

88
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:55,167
[DRAMATIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

89
00:05:00,500 --> 00:05:05,967
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]

90
00:05:06,100 --> 00:05:07,833
<i> Do you have feelings for her?</i>

91
00:05:07,967 --> 00:05:09,433
<i> See?</i>

92
00:05:09,567 --> 00:05:12,267
<i>You can't even admit it
to yourself, Andrew.</i>

93
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:15,067
<i>Because you know
you're not right for each other.</i>

94
00:05:15,200 --> 00:05:16,667
<i> You're too different.</i>

95
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:23,533
[DRAMATIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

96
00:05:25,467 --> 00:05:26,800
<i> What if they come back?</i>

97
00:05:26,933 --> 00:05:28,500
<i>Andrew, I don't want that
to happen.</i>

98
00:05:28,633 --> 00:05:30,833
<i>I won't allow that
to happen to you because...</i>

99
00:05:30,967 --> 00:05:32,300
<i>- Enough.
- you're important to me.</i>

100
00:05:32,433 --> 00:05:34,733
<i>- Joey, enough.
- I love you.</i>

101
00:05:34,900 --> 00:05:38,767
[DRAMATIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

102
00:05:38,900 --> 00:05:40,700
<i> I'm sorry, Joey.</i>

103
00:05:42,067 --> 00:05:44,133
<i> I'm really, really sorry.</i>

104
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:50,233
I'm sorry, I fought with Andrew
because he doesn't believe

105
00:05:50,367 --> 00:05:52,133
in our plan with Jin Ho.

106
00:05:53,167 --> 00:05:54,933
We got into a heated argument.

107
00:05:56,367 --> 00:05:57,367
That's all?

108
00:05:58,433 --> 00:06:01,733
It's seems like Andrew
doesn't trust our plan...

109
00:06:01,867 --> 00:06:03,767
Joey just held us back
from getting in a fight.

110
00:06:03,900 --> 00:06:05,667
So, I'm really sorry.

111
00:06:06,400 --> 00:06:09,500
[HEAVY MUSIC PLAYING]

112
00:06:10,567 --> 00:06:11,533
Child...

113
00:06:12,667 --> 00:06:15,967
We won't force you to explain.

114
00:06:17,467 --> 00:06:20,267
But if you want to say
something, remember...

115
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:22,633
your father and I are here.

116
00:06:24,067 --> 00:06:28,567
Let's postpone our plan
about Jin Ho for another day.

117
00:06:29,900 --> 00:06:32,000
No, Dad, please.

118
00:06:32,133 --> 00:06:34,400
It would be a waste.
This is our chance.

119
00:06:34,533 --> 00:06:37,700
It might be harder to catch
Jin Ho next time.

120
00:06:39,333 --> 00:06:40,867
Can you really do it?

121
00:06:44,033 --> 00:06:46,033
Everything is ready.

122
00:06:46,167 --> 00:06:48,333
And we're all together.

123
00:06:49,833 --> 00:06:52,900
So, you shouldn't worry,
Mom, Dad.

124
00:06:53,033 --> 00:06:54,533
Fine, but...

125
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:57,600
Be careful, okay?

126
00:06:58,667 --> 00:07:00,067
Let's finish this.

127
00:07:00,733 --> 00:07:07,833
[HEAVY MUSIC CONTINUES]

128
00:07:09,933 --> 00:07:12,200
Peter really is crazy.

129
00:07:12,333 --> 00:07:14,700
He knows that you're all
beaten up,

130
00:07:14,867 --> 00:07:16,367
yet he made things worse.

131
00:07:16,500 --> 00:07:18,300
Can't you dodge, Boss?

132
00:07:18,433 --> 00:07:21,967
You're so good at fighting.
You could easily handle Peter.

133
00:07:22,100 --> 00:07:23,267
No need.

134
00:07:24,533 --> 00:07:27,833
I deserve to be punched.
[LIGHT AMBIENT MUSIC PLAYING]

135
00:07:28,867 --> 00:07:30,967
Because of what I did to Joey.

136
00:07:31,100 --> 00:07:33,100
Why? What did you do?

137
00:07:36,767 --> 00:07:38,233
I rejected her.

138
00:07:39,433 --> 00:07:41,333
What?
[SCOFFS]

139
00:07:41,467 --> 00:07:43,500
Joey? We're talking about Joey?

140
00:07:44,533 --> 00:07:45,967
So?

141
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:49,067
Joey confessed her feelings
to you...

142
00:07:49,233 --> 00:07:51,900
and you rejected her? Because?

143
00:07:55,567 --> 00:07:58,533
It's obvious you have feelings
for Joey.

144
00:07:58,667 --> 00:07:59,933
That's true, Boss.

145
00:08:00,067 --> 00:08:01,800
We know.

146
00:08:01,933 --> 00:08:04,967
You think you can hide it,
but it's obvious,

147
00:08:05,100 --> 00:08:07,300
we can see that Joey
is special to you.

148
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:09,700
That's exactly it.

149
00:08:10,967 --> 00:08:13,067
I don't want her to get hurt.

150
00:08:13,200 --> 00:08:14,733
I rejected her

151
00:08:14,867 --> 00:08:16,733
because I don't want to be
the reason

152
00:08:16,867 --> 00:08:19,100
she'll put herself at risk
looking for Jin Ho.

153
00:08:20,533 --> 00:08:25,033
I don't want her feelings
to be the reason she gets hurt.

154
00:08:32,800 --> 00:08:34,633
Is that really all?

155
00:08:38,667 --> 00:08:41,633
[DAUNTING MUSIC PLAYING]

156
00:08:41,767 --> 00:08:44,333
Madam, we've been here
for an hour.

157
00:08:44,467 --> 00:08:48,033
We'll wait until he leaves.

158
00:08:49,267 --> 00:08:52,067
We'll wait as long as it takes.

159
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:57,133
[DAUNTING MUSIC CONTINUES]

160
00:08:58,667 --> 00:09:01,767
Are we really going to do this
after everything Andrew said?

161
00:09:01,900 --> 00:09:03,300
Let's just ignore him.

162
00:09:03,433 --> 00:09:05,600
You heard all that?

163
00:09:05,733 --> 00:09:08,767
Yes, sorry. I didn't mean to.

164
00:09:08,900 --> 00:09:10,867
No, don't say sorry.

165
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:14,233
You're my best friend.
I don't hide anything from you.

166
00:09:14,367 --> 00:09:17,833
[PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

167
00:09:17,967 --> 00:09:19,333
Peter...

168
00:09:19,467 --> 00:09:21,267
Why?

169
00:09:21,400 --> 00:09:25,633
Peter, I just have one request.
Can you support me?

170
00:09:26,933 --> 00:09:29,433
Do you really need to ask that?

171
00:09:30,767 --> 00:09:33,800
Peter, I'm not doing this
just for Andrew.

172
00:09:33,933 --> 00:09:36,900
I'm doing this for dad,
for my family.

173
00:09:38,367 --> 00:09:41,300
I just want the syndicate
to get caught

174
00:09:41,433 --> 00:09:44,900
so all this would end and our
lives can go back to normal.

175
00:09:46,267 --> 00:09:47,967
Can you help me do that?

176
00:09:48,100 --> 00:09:49,667
So, you can move on?

177
00:09:51,267 --> 00:09:53,300
Of course, I'm in.

178
00:09:56,167 --> 00:09:58,400
Let's go find Jin Ho.

179
00:09:58,533 --> 00:09:59,533
Let's go.

180
00:09:59,667 --> 00:10:06,833
[OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

181
00:10:08,700 --> 00:10:09,800
Jin Ho...

182
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:14,367
Joey!

183
00:10:14,867 --> 00:10:17,267
[FOREBODING MUSIC PLAYING]

184
00:10:20,467 --> 00:10:22,233
I thought you aren't coming.

185
00:10:22,367 --> 00:10:23,800
What happened to Andrew?

186
00:10:23,933 --> 00:10:24,733
How is he?

187
00:10:24,867 --> 00:10:26,800
Why did you have Andrew
beaten up?

188
00:10:27,867 --> 00:10:30,667
Or, you tried to have him killed
but you failed?

189
00:10:33,267 --> 00:10:35,567
I don't know
what you're talking about.

190
00:10:35,733 --> 00:10:37,300
Don't pretend you don't know.

191
00:10:37,433 --> 00:10:41,033
[OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

192
00:10:41,900 --> 00:10:43,033
So, what's next?

193
00:10:43,167 --> 00:10:45,033
Will you have me
and Peter killed too

194
00:10:45,167 --> 00:10:46,367
because we know the truth?

195
00:10:46,500 --> 00:10:48,200
That you're part of
the syndicate? Is that it?

196
00:10:48,333 --> 00:10:49,467
What?

197
00:10:52,633 --> 00:10:55,100
Madam, are they fighting?

198
00:10:56,267 --> 00:10:58,667
<i>That woman looks familiar to me.</i>

199
00:10:58,800 --> 00:10:59,633
<i> This could be her.</i>

200
00:10:59,767 --> 00:11:01,500
<i> That means Jin Ho knows her.</i>

201
00:11:01,633 --> 00:11:03,833
<i> The Korean is betraying you.</i>

202
00:11:03,967 --> 00:11:05,633
I don't know what you're talking
about.

203
00:11:05,767 --> 00:11:07,833
I didn't do anything to Andrew.
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

204
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,433
You were the only one who knew

205
00:11:09,567 --> 00:11:12,233
we were going to that place
that night, right?

206
00:11:12,367 --> 00:11:13,467
[SIGHS]

207
00:11:14,500 --> 00:11:16,033
No, listen.

208
00:11:16,167 --> 00:11:19,533
If I wanted to hurt him,
or any of you,

209
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:21,767
you wouldn't survive.

210
00:11:22,933 --> 00:11:26,633
I came here because
I was worried about Andrew,

211
00:11:26,767 --> 00:11:28,700
and I still want to help you.

212
00:11:28,833 --> 00:11:31,367
But you're accusing me
of so many things!

213
00:11:34,433 --> 00:11:35,500
[SIGHS]

214
00:11:39,567 --> 00:11:41,800
Joey, maybe we should listen
to Jin Ho first.

215
00:11:41,967 --> 00:11:43,533
We've been through things
together.

216
00:11:43,667 --> 00:11:46,200
What I want is for him to tell
the truth.

217
00:11:46,333 --> 00:11:47,700
Just tell us.

218
00:11:47,833 --> 00:11:51,200
Where is the syndicate hiding
and who is Berdugo?

219
00:11:51,333 --> 00:11:53,867
Okay, so you want to know
the truth?

220
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,267
Fine, I'll tell you.

221
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:56,633
Give me the gun.

222
00:11:56,767 --> 00:12:04,767
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

223
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:08,467
The truth is...

224
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:12,367
I don't owe any of you
any explanation.

225
00:12:13,933 --> 00:12:15,000
I'm leaving.

226
00:12:15,167 --> 00:12:25,133
Do not follow me.
[STIRRING MUSIC CONTINUES]

227
00:12:29,767 --> 00:12:31,067
Why, Madam?

228
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:33,100
Do you want me to take the shot?

229
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:35,733
Not yet.

230
00:12:35,867 --> 00:12:37,133
We have to leave.

231
00:12:37,267 --> 00:12:40,500
We have to get ahead of Jin Ho
before he reaches the warehouse.

232
00:12:42,367 --> 00:12:43,700
And for that girl,

233
00:12:43,833 --> 00:12:45,700
I'll deal with her
some other day.

234
00:12:47,100 --> 00:12:51,367
I want to enjoy torturing her
first before killing her.

235
00:12:52,067 --> 00:12:58,633
[STIRRING MUSIC CONTINUES]

236
00:12:58,767 --> 00:13:02,633
[SLURPING]

237
00:13:03,667 --> 00:13:05,933
So, you let Zoey poison
your mind?

238
00:13:06,067 --> 00:13:08,533
You listened to her gaslighting,
is that it?

239
00:13:08,667 --> 00:13:11,000
[PLEASANT AMBIENT MUSIC PLAYING]

240
00:13:11,133 --> 00:13:13,033
That wasn't gaslighting.

241
00:13:13,167 --> 00:13:15,267
She has a point.

242
00:13:15,400 --> 00:13:17,067
I mean, it's not like...

243
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:19,900
I hadn't thought of it
before she told me.

244
00:13:21,300 --> 00:13:23,400
Joey and I are just different.

245
00:13:25,867 --> 00:13:27,267
She's...

246
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:29,300
She's too young for me.

247
00:13:29,433 --> 00:13:34,200
Yes, she's younger than you,
but she's not naive, Andrew.

248
00:13:34,333 --> 00:13:37,500
I think with everything she's
been through with her family,

249
00:13:37,633 --> 00:13:40,133
she's already aware
of how the world works.

250
00:13:40,267 --> 00:13:44,700
What's good about Joey is that
even when she sees the bad,

251
00:13:44,833 --> 00:13:47,167
she doesn't lose hope.

252
00:13:47,300 --> 00:13:49,367
That's what you need, Boss.

253
00:13:49,500 --> 00:13:54,167
Your cynicism is balanced
by Joey's positivity.

254
00:13:54,300 --> 00:13:55,567
Actually, yes.

255
00:13:55,733 --> 00:14:00,367
Honestly, I actually think you
became a better man,

256
00:14:00,500 --> 00:14:04,467
a better journalist even,
since you met Joey.

257
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:06,300
She's a good influence on you...

258
00:14:06,433 --> 00:14:09,800
Despite the age gap
you keep making an issue.

259
00:14:10,867 --> 00:14:12,900
There's really no issue, Boss.

260
00:14:14,100 --> 00:14:15,433
But how?

261
00:14:15,567 --> 00:14:20,133
The problem is Joey is still
hurt because of what Andrew did.

262
00:14:20,267 --> 00:14:22,500
Would you forgive him
right away?

263
00:14:25,167 --> 00:14:26,600
What? What did you say?

264
00:14:27,800 --> 00:14:29,067
Nothing, Boss.

265
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:31,300
[ELAI CHUCKLES]

266
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:36,200
[CURIOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

267
00:14:44,733 --> 00:14:45,533
Joey.

268
00:14:45,667 --> 00:14:47,333
- Dad.
- How are you?

269
00:14:47,467 --> 00:14:49,767
We were unable to make him
confess.

270
00:14:49,900 --> 00:14:52,567
But still, mission accomplished.

271
00:14:52,700 --> 00:15:02,667
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

272
00:15:09,533 --> 00:15:12,033
Jin Ho isn't our only target.

273
00:15:12,400 --> 00:15:13,833
He's just a small fish.
[OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

274
00:15:15,133 --> 00:15:17,000
He'll lead us to the depths
of the sea

275
00:15:17,800 --> 00:15:19,400
where the sharks are.

276
00:15:19,867 --> 00:15:22,067
[OMINOUS MUSIC CONTINUES]

277
00:15:23,900 --> 00:15:25,800
[CLACKS]

278
00:15:26,967 --> 00:15:35,033
[OMINOUS MUSIC CONTINUES]

279
00:15:45,933 --> 00:15:48,567
We placed a tracker
on Jin Ho's vehicle.

280
00:15:49,367 --> 00:15:52,467
Last movement recorded
is at 2:17 AM.

281
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:55,033
Since then, he hasn't moved
from this area,

282
00:15:55,167 --> 00:15:57,700
here at Bolivar Mushroom
Chips Manufacturing.

283
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:02,100
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

284
00:16:03,067 --> 00:16:06,467
Is there prior intel
on this facility?

285
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:09,467
It's written here
in Ramon's notebook.

286
00:16:09,633 --> 00:16:12,933
There's a mushroom chip
manufacturing in this area.

287
00:16:13,067 --> 00:16:16,700
Maybe they changed the address
on the label,

288
00:16:16,967 --> 00:16:18,267
that's why we got confused.

289
00:16:18,400 --> 00:16:20,767
Some of our people also
did surveillance, Sir.

290
00:16:20,900 --> 00:16:23,233
There are movements,
looks like deliveries.

291
00:16:23,367 --> 00:16:25,933
And armed men are guarding
the compound.

292
00:16:26,067 --> 00:16:29,400
Prepare coordination
with the RTC duty judge.

293
00:16:29,533 --> 00:16:32,067
We'll expedite a search warrant.

294
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:34,933
And good thing I already spoke
with the DDE.

295
00:16:35,067 --> 00:16:37,433
They'll be joining
the operation.

296
00:16:39,167 --> 00:16:41,000
[KNOCK ON THE DOOR]

297
00:16:43,833 --> 00:16:44,800
Sir.

298
00:16:45,833 --> 00:16:50,267
[DAUNTING MUSIC PLAYING]

299
00:16:51,567 --> 00:16:53,367
So, the rumors were true.

300
00:16:53,500 --> 00:16:55,867
Major Miguel Delgado is alive.

301
00:16:57,267 --> 00:16:59,800
And you've already reunited
with your daughter.

302
00:17:02,167 --> 00:17:04,100
You know that Joey
is my daughter?

303
00:17:04,233 --> 00:17:05,567
Yes, Sir.

304
00:17:05,700 --> 00:17:08,033
She was with us in Valmora, Dad.

305
00:17:08,167 --> 00:17:10,833
Andrew's friend.

306
00:17:11,167 --> 00:17:12,700
Friend?

307
00:17:13,067 --> 00:17:15,100
You know that we were
more than that.

308
00:17:19,433 --> 00:17:20,633
[CLEARS THROAT]

309
00:17:20,900 --> 00:17:23,500
All right, mission first.

310
00:17:23,767 --> 00:17:26,033
Clarissa, can we have the room?

311
00:17:26,167 --> 00:17:28,533
Sir, wait! What about Jin Ho?

312
00:17:28,667 --> 00:17:31,567
What if you run into him?
What will happen to him?

313
00:17:31,700 --> 00:17:34,467
If he fires at us,
we'll fire back.

314
00:17:34,600 --> 00:17:36,933
We cannot guarantee
he'll be taken alive.

315
00:17:37,067 --> 00:17:42,067
[UNEASY MUSIC PLAYING]

316
00:17:46,033 --> 00:17:51,033
[PHONE RINGING]

317
00:17:53,733 --> 00:17:56,200
Elai, can we just air
a replay for now?

318
00:17:56,333 --> 00:17:58,533
I really need to talk to Joey.

319
00:17:58,667 --> 00:18:01,867
What you did to Joey
was very harsh.

320
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:03,700
I had to do it to protect her.

321
00:18:03,833 --> 00:18:04,933
[PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

322
00:18:05,067 --> 00:18:08,067
But I know that I could've
handled it better.

323
00:18:08,200 --> 00:18:10,333
<i> I was wrong to hurt her,</i>

324
00:18:10,467 --> 00:18:13,433
especially when she had
the courage

325
00:18:13,567 --> 00:18:16,200
to tell me what she feels.

326
00:18:16,333 --> 00:18:17,800
<i> How about you?</i>

327
00:18:17,933 --> 00:18:21,400
When will you have the courage
to tell her what you feel?

328
00:18:21,567 --> 00:18:25,367
That wasn't part of the<i> Bisaya
</i>lessons you taught me.

329
00:18:25,500 --> 00:18:28,467
[CHUCKLES]
Well, that's your problem.

330
00:18:28,600 --> 00:18:29,300
[CHUCKLES]

331
00:18:37,433 --> 00:18:47,400
- [PHONE RINGING]
- [TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

332
00:18:59,567 --> 00:19:02,833
Jin Ho, answer it
if you don't want to die.

333
00:19:02,967 --> 00:19:05,600
Peter, what are you doing?

334
00:19:05,733 --> 00:19:09,933
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

335
00:19:14,333 --> 00:19:15,567
Who are you talking to?
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

336
00:19:16,667 --> 00:19:17,633
No one.

337
00:19:17,767 --> 00:19:18,867
Let me see.

338
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:20,633
I said no one.

339
00:19:20,767 --> 00:19:21,800
No...

340
00:19:22,867 --> 00:19:26,100
[PHONE RINGING]

341
00:19:31,667 --> 00:19:34,267
Don't call again.
I'm blocking you.

342
00:19:35,600 --> 00:19:41,633
[STIRRING MUSIC CONTINUES]

343
00:19:43,400 --> 00:19:45,833
Peter, why are you calling
Jin Ho?

344
00:19:45,967 --> 00:19:48,533
I just want to tell Jin
to leave the syndicate.

345
00:19:48,667 --> 00:19:50,233
What?
[OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

346
00:19:50,367 --> 00:19:53,267
Do you really want to ruin
dad's operation?

347
00:19:53,400 --> 00:19:54,367
Joey,

348
00:19:55,433 --> 00:19:58,133
I just want Jin Ho
to save himself.

349
00:19:58,267 --> 00:20:00,433
There's still hope
for our friend!

350
00:20:03,033 --> 00:20:04,867
Joey, I know Jin Ho.

351
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:07,500
I've been with him
more than you and Andrew.

352
00:20:07,633 --> 00:20:09,967
That's why I know
he was genuine with us.

353
00:20:11,067 --> 00:20:13,400
He felt bad when he found out
we suspected him

354
00:20:13,533 --> 00:20:15,067
with what happened to Andrew.

355
00:20:17,667 --> 00:20:18,933
Fine, here's what I'll do.

356
00:20:19,067 --> 00:20:21,833
I'll ask dad that,
as much as possible,

357
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:23,800
they won't hurt Jin Ho,

358
00:20:23,933 --> 00:20:26,100
that they'll force him
to surrender.

359
00:20:28,300 --> 00:20:29,933
Thank you.

360
00:20:30,067 --> 00:20:32,767
I'll just find the right time
to talk to dad.

361
00:20:32,900 --> 00:20:34,200
Joey, my phone...

362
00:20:34,333 --> 00:20:36,367
I'll keep it for now.

363
00:20:36,533 --> 00:20:38,733
You might warn Jin Ho again.

364
00:20:40,233 --> 00:20:44,233
Peter, dad's operation
cannot fail.

365
00:20:46,267 --> 00:20:48,000
We worked hard for this.

366
00:20:49,033 --> 00:20:59,000
[OMINOUS MUSIC CONTINUES]

367
00:21:02,400 --> 00:21:04,700
It's a go, everyone.

368
00:21:04,833 --> 00:21:06,600
You all know our objective.

369
00:21:07,633 --> 00:21:10,067
Let's all be careful. Let's go!

370
00:21:11,133 --> 00:21:12,167
Yes, Sir.

371
00:21:16,867 --> 00:21:18,200
[GUN COCKS]

372
00:21:20,933 --> 00:21:22,567
Miguel, wait.

373
00:21:22,700 --> 00:21:26,000
Why? I thought you weren't
joining the operation?

374
00:21:26,133 --> 00:21:27,567
Love, this is the last one.

375
00:21:28,967 --> 00:21:30,500
I don't know.

376
00:21:30,633 --> 00:21:32,767
I'm nervous, Miguel.

377
00:21:32,900 --> 00:21:35,233
We have the element of surprise.

378
00:21:35,367 --> 00:21:37,467
They don't know we're coming.

379
00:21:37,600 --> 00:21:39,200
[PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

380
00:21:39,333 --> 00:21:42,867
This is the chance to bring down
the syndicate.

381
00:21:43,033 --> 00:21:47,433
They destroyed our family,
so I need to be there.

382
00:21:47,567 --> 00:21:48,667
Miguel...

383
00:21:50,500 --> 00:21:52,900
That's why I admire you
so much, Dad.

384
00:21:53,033 --> 00:21:54,667
Just be careful, okay?

385
00:21:55,700 --> 00:21:56,933
Thank you.

386
00:21:57,567 --> 00:22:01,167
[EMOTIONAL MUSIC PLAYING]

387
00:22:02,633 --> 00:22:04,367
But, Dad...

388
00:22:04,500 --> 00:22:07,533
Can you promise that
if you catch Jin Ho,

389
00:22:07,900 --> 00:22:10,500
you won't hurt him?
Just arrest him.

390
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:14,333
I can't promise that,
my child...

391
00:22:15,667 --> 00:22:17,267
But I'll try.

392
00:22:18,267 --> 00:22:27,300
[EMOTIONAL MUSIC CONTINUES]

393
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:46,833
[UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING]

394
00:22:48,200 --> 00:22:50,333
- We have a search warrant.
- Search all you want.

395
00:22:50,500 --> 00:22:52,533
- Secure this place!
- Did you see Peter?

396
00:22:52,667 --> 00:22:55,433
- No, I didn't notice him.
- His phone is also gone.

397
00:22:55,567 --> 00:22:56,667
Joey, don't be mad, okay?

398
00:22:56,800 --> 00:22:58,767
But I'm here at the warehouse
to warn Jin Ho.

399
00:22:58,900 --> 00:22:59,933
Peter, come on!

400
00:23:00,067 --> 00:23:02,100
- Clear! Move!
- Where are they?

401
00:23:02,233 --> 00:23:03,867
Stop! Hands in the air!

402
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:05,033
Drop your guns!

403
00:23:05,167 --> 00:23:07,567
None of you will leave
this place alive!

404
00:23:07,700 --> 00:23:10,100
I'm not leaving while my father
is inside fighting!

405
00:23:10,233 --> 00:23:14,767
At long last, we meet, woman.
Do the honors, Jin Ho.

406
00:23:14,900 --> 00:23:17,900
This is your last chance
to prove your loyalty.
